  "description": "A mysterious package of potatoes arrives for Park Tae-Ho, a hungry unemployed man. Following a single letter from his grandfather, he ends up in the rural village of “Hongwol-ri,” where he reunites with his arch-rival, Hyeon Seung-Ju, the son of a chaebol tycoon. A potato-farming showdown between the two men begins with the mysterious potatoes found in a secret warehouse. But as they plow the fields together, fight, tumble around, and even weather a typhoon... For some reason, his heart keeps acting strange. A chaotic country life with his arch-rival, where not a single day goes by without a commotion. But why… does his heart keep fluttering?\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
